Z||000005||Monkeyman||03-13-2000||10:07 PM||||Sorry, guys.  I had some difficulties with either my computer or accessing the forum yesterday.  Besides, do you know how long it takes to wipe a couple of gallons of drool off of a car??? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  It's home!!!  We did have a few mostly minor problems and the GT (now and forever known as "Grape Ape") isn't as nice as I was led to believe, but it's mine, all mine!!!<P>1st--We had to pick the one weekend in March when it snowed 6".  The ABS on WT IIIs dads van quit working once (no damage--Whew!).  We stayed up a little late discussing other business Saturday night so I was a little tired on Sunday (pickup day), but that really had alot to do with the fact that I was too damn excited to sleep more than an hour!  Once we got up to Wheaton (NW suburb of Chicago), the seller didn't have the title notorized (that's just not spelled that way, is it?) and we had to drive an extra 10 miles to get the car.  Someone had stolen the vent off of the R side (which actually was a blessing in disguise as they had also broken the trunk lock (screwdriver) and the battery was dead).  We finally got the Grape Ape up on the dolly (don't rent the ones that swivel as they are a real b***h to back up!).  Once we got it back home, we tried to push it off of the dolly.  After lots of sweat, the car finally started to move.  Of course, it picked up speed way too fast.  Almost ran it into the Monkeymobile.  Luckily, WT III was quick on the draw and jumped in the car and on the brakes just in time!  (One more thank you, WT III!)<P>There are tons of things that need to be fixed, but most are cosmetic so they can be done as money allows.  I'll keep everyone posted on my progress.  Even though the Grape Ape is in worse shape than I thought, I still came out well.  The tires are almost brand new Pirellis and the rims are in excellent shape.  I figure I have about $1000 worth of rolling stock.<P>I'm getting a little long winded.  I'll post more later.   <P>WAAAHOOOOO!!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000006||ChadMan||03-14-2000||09:01 AM||||Monkeyman, congratulations!  And I'm truly touched that you chose the name Grape Ape!||||reg||14
